                    "faIconColors": {"bg": "", "fill": ""},
                    "locales": {
                        "en": {
                            "text": "<p>I'm a {{Ruby on Rails}} developer at [[ZIGEXN VENTURA]]. I work with Rails, AWS, MySQL, and MongoDB to build scalable recruitment platforms.</p><p>Outside of work, I enjoy [[playing sports]] and [[cooking]]. I'm always looking for new challenges and opportunities to grow.</p><p>Feel free to [[reach out!]]</p>"
                        },
                        "es": {
                            "text": "<p>Soy desarrollador de {{Ruby on Rails}} en [[ZIGEXN VENTURA]]. Trabajo con Rails, AWS, MySQL y MongoDB.</p><p>Fuera del trabajo, disfruto del [[deporte]] y la [[cocina]].</p><p>¡No dudes en [[contactarme!]]</p>"
                        },
                        "fr": {
                            "text": "<p>Je suis développeur {{Ruby on Rails}} chez [[ZIGEXN VENTURA]]. Je travaille avec Rails, AWS, MySQL et MongoDB.</p><p>En dehors du travail, j'aime le [[sport]] et la [[cuisine]].</p><p>N'hésitez pas à [[me contacter !]]</p>"
                        },
                        "ko": {
                            "text": "<p>저는 [[ZIGEXN VENTURA]]의 {{Ruby on Rails}} 개발자입니다. Rails, AWS, MySQL, MongoDB를 활용하여 채용 플랫폼을 개발합니다.</p><p>업무 외에는 [[스포츠]]와 [[요리]]를 즐깁니다.</p><p>언제든지 [[연락 주세요!]]</p>"
                        }
